<title>USA: Lone Star Industries names Troutman CEO.</title>
<headline>Lone Star Industries names Troutman CEO.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lone Star Industries Inc said Thursday its board has elected William Troutman chief executive officer of the company.</p>
<p>Troutman replaces David Wallace as CEO, the company said. Wallace will remain chairman and Troutman will also continue as president, a position he has held since 1990, it said.</p>
<p>Lone Star produces cement, ready-mixed concrete and other construction materials.</p>
